              "description": "Right-angled triangle with vertical left leg y cm, horizontal base x cm, descending hypotenuse 13.7 cm and an interior 26.5° angle at the lower-right vertex. Ordinary source-blue outlines are reconstructed in house black.",
              "mathematics": "The hypotenuse is 13.7 cm; x is adjacent and y is opposite the given 26.5° angle. Coordinates derive the acute angle and perpendicular legs.",
