            "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source page 43, p43-q6-b-diagram\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[line join=round,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\coordinate (A) at (0,0);\n\\coordinate (B) at (4,0);\n\\coordinate (C) at (4,{-4*8/15});\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (A)--(B)--(C)--cycle;\n\\pic[draw=black,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=2.5mm] {right angle = A--B--C};\n\\pic[draw=black,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=9mm] {angle = C--A--B};\n\\pic[draw=black,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=6mm] {angle = B--C--A};\n\\path (A)--(B) node[midway,above=3pt] {$15$};\n\\path (B)--(C) node[midway,right=3pt] {$8$};\n\\path (A)--(C) node[midway,below left=2pt] {$17$};\n\\path (A) ++(-14.036:12mm) node {$\\alpha$};\n\\path (C) ++(120.964:9mm) node {$\\theta$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
            "src": null,
            "widthMm": 62,
            "alt": "Mathematical diagram",
            "overlayOf": null,
            "transparent": false,
            "axes": null,
            "spec": {
              "sourcePage": 43,
              "sourceRegion": "Question 6b, lower-right diagram",
              "description": "Triangle with horizontal upper leg 15, vertical right leg 8 and descending hypotenuse 17. The right angle is at the upper right, α at the left and θ at the lower right. Both acute angles retain interior arcs. Ordinary source-blue outlines are reconstructed in house black.",
              "mathematics": "The perpendicular legs have ratio 15:8 and the hypotenuse is 17. Relative to α, the opposite side is 8; relative to θ, the opposite side is 15.",
              "answerVisibility": "All three supplied lengths and both unknown angle labels remain visible; no calculated angles are printed."
            },
            "derived": false,
            "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
          }
        ],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\alpha=28^{\\circ}4',\\quad\\theta=61^{\\circ}56'$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sin\\alpha&=\\frac{8}{17}\\\\\\alpha&=\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac{8}{17}\\right)\\\\\\alpha&\\approx28^{\\circ}4'21''\\\\\\alpha&\\approx28^{\\circ}4'\\\\\\sin\\theta&=\\frac{15}{17}\\\\\\theta&=\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac{15}{17}\\right)\\\\\\theta&\\approx61^{\\circ}55'39''\\\\\\theta&\\approx61^{\\circ}56'\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
